{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/application(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey"],"anchor":"The-app","title":"The app"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/device(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey"],"anchor":"The-device","title":"The device"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/operatingSystem(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey"],"anchor":"The-operating-system","title":"The operating system"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/locale(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey"],"anchor":"The-locale","title":"The locale"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/network()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey"],"anchor":"The-network-connection","title":"The network connection"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/vendorIdentifier()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey"],"anchor":"The-identifier-for-vendor","title":"The identifier for vendor"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"StandardContext"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"StandardContext","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"StandardContext"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each standard value has an enricher of its own, and nothing is added to a record until the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"builds its tracker with that enricher. Each one sets a typed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" key whose value a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination reads from the record’s context: "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The app, device, operating system and locale are read once, when the enricher is made, never per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event. The network connection changes while the app runs, so on Apple platforms ","type":"text"},{"code":"network()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NWPathMonitor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of its own and sets the latest connection on each record. Give each tracker its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own call. Off Apple platforms there is no device and no path monitor, so those two enrichers set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing, and a server or tool, whose process usually has no Info.plist, passes its own app to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"application(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"vendorIdentifier()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", made on the main actor, adds the platform’s identifier for vendor as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value. It is the one identifier here that outlives a session, so add it only when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app has decided to and has the user’s consent. It is never stored or made up: on macOS and Linux,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which have none, records carry no key.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the session an event was tracked in, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sessions"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import StandardContext","import Trackers","","let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.application(), .operatingSystem(), .locale(), .network()])","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","\/\/ A destination reads each value from the record's context:","\/\/ record.context[ApplicationKey.self]?.version, record.context[OperatingSystemKey.self]?.name"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/sessionsandstandardcontext","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers each value and the identifier for vendor in more detail."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"variant